Divij Vaidya created KAFKA-15158:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Add metrics for RemoteRequestsPerSec
                 Key: KAFKA-15158
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15158
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Divij Vaidya
             Fix For: 3.6.0


Add the following metrics for better observability into the RemoteLog relat=
ed activities inside the broker.

1. RemoteWriteRequestsPerSec


2. RemoteDeleteRequestsPerSec


3. BuildRemoteLogAuxStateRequestsPerSec

=C2=A0

These metrics will be calculated at topic level (we can add them at brokerT=
opicStats)


*RemoteWriteRequestsPerSec* will be marked on every call to RemoteLogManage=
r#
copyLogSegmentsToRemote()
=C2=A0
*RemoteDeleteRequestsPerSec* will be marked on every call to RemoteLogManag=
er#cleanupExpiredRemoteLogSegments(). This method is introduced in [https:/=
/github.com/apache/kafka/pull/13561]=C2=A0

*BuildRemoteLogAuxStateRequestsPerSec* will be marked on every call to Repl=
icaFetcherTierStateMachine#buildRemoteLogAuxState()
=C2=A0



