Hi Erik,

Sorry, I spoke imprecisely. My concern is not concurrent access, but mul=
tithreaded access in general. Basically cache line visibility issues.

>  > This is true even if the accesses happen at different times, becaus=
e=20
> > modern CPUs require memory barriers to guarantee inter-thread visibi=
lty=20
> > of loads and stores.
