> after reading from and writing to a threadlocal variable, providing th=
e=20
> barriers right there.
>

I don't see any documentation that accessing thread local variables prov=
ides a total store or load barrier. Do you have such documentation? It s=
eems like if this were the case, we could eliminate volatile variables f=
rom most of the code base.

>  > I know that there are at least a few locks in the consumer code now=
,=20
> > due to our need to send heartbeats from a worker thread. I don't thi=
nk=20
