Utkarsh Khare created KAFKA-15193:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: Allow choosing Platform specific rocksDBJNI jar
                 Key: KAFKA-15193
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15193
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: build
            Reporter: Utkarsh Khare
            Assignee: Utkarsh Khare


RocksDBJNI uber jar is currently at ~58MBs.=C2=A0
There are smaller platform-specific jars available for RocksDB.=C2=A0

This ticket is created to allow developers to choose platform-specific Rock=
sDB jar via build arguments, which is much smaller and can considerably red=
uce the generated RPM size.=C2=A0=C2=A0

=C2=A0



