I think this is out of scope.

> 3. Should we have a new entity-type in kafka-configs for setting
> controller configs?

The BROKER entity type already applies to controllers. It probably needs=
 a new name (NODE would be better) but that's out of scope for this KIP,=
 I think.

best,
Colin


