>> https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/513e1c641d63c5e15144f9fcdafa1b56c5e5ba09/metadata/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/controller/ConfigurationControlManager.java#L281
>> >> >   - And passed to policy:
